      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Keen to see the unbeaten TENNESSEE BOUND (3) step up to Saturday grade and the Maher stable couldn't have found a better race for her. She proved too good fresh at 1000m from just off the pace before controlling the tempo and bolting in last time at Sandown Lakeside. She did have the pattern well and truly onside there but she should just prove too fast from the inside gate again. LUNA CAT (5) is flying, a smart winner over this route two back before just being bloused late last time out. Gets Willo onboard here down in the weights and will be dashing late. SALSA FELLOW (1) won two on the bounce before a good effort in the Golden Topaz at Swan Hill when finishing off strongly for fourth. Back in grade here and should go well. BEHAVIOUR (8) is next best off a sound run here last time.",
